# ShopEase - E-Commerce Product Website

A semantic HTML5 e-commerce website built as a capstone project.

## Features

- Semantic HTML5
- Header & Navigation
- Hero Banner
- Product Categories
- Featured Products
- Product Details
- Product Specifications
- Product Gallery
- Customer Reviews
- Shipping Information
- FAQ
- Contact Section
- Footer

## Technologies Used

- HTML5

## Future Improvements

- Responsive CSS
- JavaScript Shopping Cart
- Product Search
- User Login
- Payment Integration
- MERN Stack Backend

